      "text": "KING JOHN.\n[To Eleanor] So shall it be; your grace shall stay behind\nSo strongly guarded.\n[To Arthur] Cousin, look not sad.\nThy grandam loves thee, and thy uncle will\nAs dear be to thee as thy father was.",
