      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "BASTARD.\nBell, book, and candle shall not drive me back\nWhen gold and silver becks me to come on.\nI leave your highness. Grandam, I will pray,\nIf ever I remember to be holy,\nFor your fair safety; so, I kiss your hand.",
