      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "KING JOHN.\nEnough.\nI could be merry now. Hubert, I love thee.\nWell, I’ll not say what I intend for thee.\nRemember. Madam, fare you well.\nI’ll send those powers o’er to your majesty.",
